# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and never leaves your machine;
# the scripts pipe the value into a Cloudflare Worker secret.
#
# Garmin Personal API key: create it at https://connect.garmin.com/app/settings/personalApiToken
# (shown only once; choose an expiry of 30/90/180 days or 1 year).
GARMIN_API_KEY=
